---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="The Operator: Christopher Campbell" description="Technology, construction, and insurance formed the operating discipline behind SecureProspective.">
  <Nav />
  <main transition:name="page-card">
    <section class="record-hero">
      <div class="record-hero-grid shell">
        <div class="record-hero-index"><span>FILE // OPERATOR</span><span>C. CAMPBELL</span></div>
        <div class="record-hero-copy">
          <h1>Built inside the work.</h1>
          <p>
            Christopher Campbell did not leave operating responsibility behind to become a consultant.
            SecureProspective is being built from inside the business he still has to run.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="record-section record-section--white">
      <div class="record-section-grid shell">
        <aside class="record-margin"><strong>CAREER // 01</strong><span>Technology</span></aside>
        <div class="record-body">
          <h2>The passion.<br />Look forward.</h2>
          <p>
            Technology taught Christopher to see the future state before it arrives and build toward it.
            He started at MCI WorldCom in 1999 at age nineteen, then worked field deployments for Bank of America,
            the USDA wide-area network, and Cisco infrastructure. Twenty-six years in technology make the
            prospective half of the name practical, not fashionable.
          </p>
          <table class="fact-table"><tbody>
            <tr><th scope="row">Started</th><td>MCI WorldCom, 1999</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Field environments</th><td>Bank of America, USDA WAN, Cisco infrastructure</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Method contribution</th><td>Transform</td></tr>
          </tbody></table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="record-section record-section--silver">
      <div class="record-section-grid shell">
        <aside class="record-margin"><strong>CAREER // 02</strong><span>Construction</span></aside>
        <div class="record-body">
          <h2>The objective truth.<br />Read what is real.</h2>
          <p>
            Fifteen years of electrical work across commercial, residential, and military environments.
            Voltage is present or it is not. Code is right or it is wrong. There is no persuasive language
            that repairs a false reading. That discipline became Diagnose.
          </p>
          <table class="fact-table"><tbody>
            <tr><th scope="row">Duration</th><td>Fifteen years</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Work</th><td>Commercial, residential, military bases, low voltage, fire alarm</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Method contribution</th><td>Diagnose</td></tr>
          </tbody></table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="record-section record-section--blue">
      <div class="record-section-grid shell">
        <aside class="record-margin"><strong>CAREER // 03</strong><span>Insurance</span></aside>
        <div class="record-body">
          <h2>The responsibility.<br />Secure what matters.</h2>
          <p>
            Life insurance, annuity, producer development, and running an IMO put long-range outcomes in the
            work. Approximately $110M in annuity production assisted over six years, approximately $18M in
            current annual volume, and eight active producers. Insurance made Position and Shape obligations,
            not design language.
          </p>
          <table class="fact-table"><tbody>
            <tr><th scope="row">License</th><td>Texas Life, Health, and Annuity 3096607</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Specialty</th><td>FERS, CSRS, TSP, FEHB, and LEO, ATC, and researcher variations</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Method contribution</th><td>Position and Shape</td></tr>
          </tbody></table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="record-section record-section--ink">
      <div class="record-section-grid shell">
        <aside class="record-margin"><strong>COMBINED</strong><span>Operating spine</span></aside>
        <div class="record-body">
          <h2>Forward motion under responsibility.</h2>
          <p>
            Technology looks ahead. Construction refuses a false reading. Insurance protects the person who
            lives with the outcome. SecureProspective joins all three inside one operating business.
          </p>
          <div class="quote-field">Secure the foundation. Build the prospective state.</div>
          <a class="action action--signal" href="/contact">Start a direct conversation <span>→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
